3. Contracts → compiler lane; outside this session (muse).
4. Reproducible builds → 9/9 wired + pinned; closed.
5. Even evidence is verified → 9/9 repos with red-team CI; closed.
6. Self-hosting → compiler lane; outside this session (muse).
7. Multi-target → Track 1 closed. Sovereign LLVM IR lowering engine
